[ti:(untitled)]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Bas ek pyala hoon... Par bahut matwala hoon,
[00:16.62]Bhari jindagi hai mujh mein... Main adbhut, matwala hoon.
[00:25.23]Kabhi shyaam rang sa gwala ban...
[00:33.85]Main sabko khud mein samaye ek pyala hoon.
[00:42.47]Log dekhte hain mujhko ek maati ka bartan,
[00:51.08]Par mujhmein chhalakta hai anant ka darshan.
[00:59.70]Kahin prem ki amrit dhara, kahin vish ka main jwala hoon,
[01:08.32]Main shunya se janma, har rang mein dhalne wala hoon.
[01:16.94]Mere kan-kan mein basi hai us murli ki taan,
[01:25.55]Main thirakta hoon jaise ho gopiyon ka gaan.
[01:34.17]Na koi bandhan mujhko bhaye, na main kisi ka paala hoon,
[01:42.79]Main swayam mein poorn, swayam ka hi ujaala hoon.
[01:51.40]Main pyala, tu pyala...
[02:00.02]Bhari andar dono mein jwaala!
[02:08.64]Ek hi agni, do alag bhed,
[02:17.25]Mita do ab ye man ka khed.
[02:25.87]Na tu mujhse alag, na main tujhse juda,
[02:34.49]Is jwaala mein hi chhipa hai khuda.
[02:43.10]Khaali dikhta hoon par bharapoor hoon main,
[02:51.72]Har dard se, har ranj se door hoon main.
[03:00.34]Main hi madira, main hi saaqi, main hi peene wala hoon,
[03:08.96]Main hi niyati, main hi maati, main hi rakhwala hoon.
[03:17.57]Bhari jindagi hai mujh mein...
[03:26.19]Main sabko khud mein samaye ek pyala hoon.
[03:34.81]Main adbhut, matwala hoon...
